      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Absolutely, let's tackle this with a bit of a \"goblin-proof\" approach. First, you'll want to gather your Yubikeys, the trusty little goblin-fighting tools. Now, here's your step-by-step guide to implementing these magical devices across your law firm:\n\n1. **Gather Your Yubikeys**: Start by purchasing enough Yubikeys for all the staff members. Make sure you have a few extra for any unexpected goblin-sized mishaps.\n\n2. **Set Up a Yubikey Manager**: Use a Yubikey Manager to keep track of your Yubikeys. This will help you ensure that each goblin (or staff member) has their own unique key.\n\n3. **Configure Your Systems**: Update your systems to support Yubikeys. This might involve installing drivers or updating software. Make sure your IT team is ready to handle any goblin-sized technical issues that arise.\n\n4. **Create a Yubikey Policy**: Draft a policy that outlines how Yubikeys should be used. Include guidelines on how to register and enroll Yubikeys, how to handle lost keys, and how to troubleshoot common issues. This will help keep the goblins at",
